          "Content": [
            {
              "id": 88,
              "Title": "Weddings",
              "Text": "Celebrate your special day in style at our idyllic wedding venue. With beautiful indoor and outdoor spaces, customised catering and expert event planning, we turn dreams into reality.\n\nWhether you envision an intimate ceremony or a grand celebration, our dedicated weddings team will guide you through every detail. Explore elegant décor packages, bespoke menus and accommodation options for you and your guests.\n\nPlease **call 3** from your room's telephone and we'll be happy to help you with your special day.\n\n![wedding_b9feedfe52.jpg](https://dedicated-bear-2ac79917c8.media.strapiapp.com/wedding_b9feedfe52_dc80b35c9e.jpg)",
              "Media": null,
              "Photoslider": null
            }
          ]
        },
