          "Content": [
            {
              "id": 91,
              "Title": "Conferences",
              "Text": "Host impactful, large-scale conferences in our spacious ballroom - ideal for up to 200 delegates seated theatre-style. Designed for versatility and comfort, the space is supported by breakout rooms, networking lounges and dedicated exhibition areas.\n\nWe offer flexible delegate packages that can include coffee breaks, working lunches and evening receptions, all curated to enhance engagement and productivity throughout the day.\n\nOur events team will work closely with you to ensure every detail is covered - from setup and signage to tech support and catering. Submit your preferred dates and requirements through this tab and we’ll provide a tailored quotation and event plan.\n\nMake your next conference seamless, professional and unforgettable.\n\n![6721_4813fcb8ff.jpg](https://dedicated-bear-2ac79917c8.media.strapiapp.com/6721_4813fcb8ff_b2cce6afcc.jpg)\n\n![6717_2e3b5e34d5.jpg](https://dedicated-bear-2ac79917c8.media.strapiapp.com/6717_2e3b5e34d5_8a510c0fd2.jpg)",
              "Media": null,
